{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id25081757"}, "name":{"label":"emilynchanted"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-09-24T01:07:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8"}, "id":{"label":"9115998998"}, "title":{"label":"Have never loved an app like this"}, "content":{"label":"I look forward to checking the weather. There are features in here I didn’t even know I wanted in a weather app (like telling me the best hours for photography). I’m constantly playing the secret missions, trying to unlock stupid achievements, playing with layouts, sending screenshots of the hilarious weather reports to friends, and more!\n\nMy only criticism is that the temperatures for the “just right” range (that’s right the app can tell you if it’s going to be hot or cold based on YOUR definition of hot and cold - love it!!) are still warmer than my preferences!! The lowest range is 16c-24c but my just right range is more like 12c-21c. Please consider recalibrating for people who want to live in perpetual autumn weather and hate it when it’s over 20c and they have to ditch their cardigans!! I can say my hot threshold is over 21c so why would my “just right” range be able to be above that?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"5"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"9"}}, 
