{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id121931021"}, "name":{"label":"Jemson108"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-18T17:33:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.6.4"}, "id":{"label":"8684942682"}, "title":{"label":"Too expensive!"}, "content":{"label":"I literally bought this app because I wanted the widgets, I didn’t know I’d have to pay another £6.99 per year to have this basic feature!! On top of paying £4.99 to have the app? It’s too much! And it’s a shame because this app is very nicely polished, I really like it, and I’m happy to pay the £4.99, but that is all. It’s a weather app, not Netflix. It’s not like dev is having to pay out loads of money to fund new shows etc, all dev has to do is keep app updated and competitive, which is well within the remit of the £4.99 I already paid. Please sort it out, greed is not a virtue", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
