{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1375505325"}, "name":{"label":"Katsy Kat"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-15T14:54:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.6.4"}, "id":{"label":"8674925907"}, "title":{"label":"Like it, but keeps asking for moneyy aaaa"}, "content":{"label":"Love the humour involved and the graphics, but i just want an app to see slightly into the future so i can check for snow or thunderstorms, but i gotta pay £20!! May use the app occasionally but i won’t be dependant on it… ☹️", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id176552906"}, "name":{"label":"StoneColdBush"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-13T15:52:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.6.4"}, "id":{"label":"8668004777"}, "title":{"label":"Source Issues"}, "content":{"label":"I really, really like this app but there’s an issue with data sources that always makes me revert back to Apple Weather or WeatherPro… I prefer to use either dark sky (which I think uses MetOffice in the UK) or meteogroup for weather in the UK (because MetOffice isn’t an option) but this means I cannot get air quality or pollen counts because this is only available with AccuWeather in carrot. \nUntil I can get UK/European weather sources for all my needs including UV, pollen, and air quality I’ll just have to keep the free version for now.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id144256970"}, "name":{"label":"Veejp123"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-04-30T12:45:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.6.2"}, "id":{"label":"8623121935"}, "title":{"label":"1 star customer service"}, "content":{"label":"Until 2 weeks ago carrot was my go to weather app. I had paid for premium for a year too. Suddenly the weather widget didn’t work correctly and when I contacted support they told me everything was working as intended even after screenshots and video to show how it was not working correctly. I waited a week to see if there would be any updates but nothing so put in a refund request which was accepted and now I’ll delete the app. Avoid, the customer service will mug you off if you encounter bugs.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
